    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43727" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">septem-flŭus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		fluo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>sevenfold-flowing</i>, an Ovidian epithet of the Nile (as
			having seven mouths): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nilus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					1, 422</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flumina Nili,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 15, 753</span></i>
			 (cf. the foll. art. and septemplex).</div>
